    {
      "title": "共学 D2：套利分层——价差、MEV 与执行成本",
      "author": "Paxon Qiao",
      "digest": "套利不是只有 MEV。价差套利找目标、MEV 拼手段、API 套利拼策略。今天盘了 Gate CrossEx、Backp",
      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>MoonPub Preview</title>\n</head>\n<body style=\"margin:0;background:#f6f7f9;padding:24px 12px;\">\n<main style=\"box-sizing: border-box; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; background:#fff; padding:28px 24px; box-shadow:0 12px 36px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);\">\n<section style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang SC', 'Hiragino Sans GB', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.05em; color: #24292f; background: #f6f8fa; padding: 0 4px;\">\n\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Cover</title>\n<style>\n*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}\nbody{width:900px;height:500px;overflow:hidden;font-family:'SF Pro Text',-apple-system,'PingFang SC','Hiragino Sans GB','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;background:#030712}\n.cover{width:900px;height:500px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:radial-gradient(circle at 78% 18%,rgba(34,197,94,.22),transparent 25%),linear-gradient(135deg,#020617 0%,#0b1020 48%,#111827 100%);color:#e5edf7;padding:64px 76px}\n.grid{position:absolute;inset:0;background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(148,163,184,.08) 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:34px 34px;opacity:.65}\n.glow{position:absolute;right:74px;top:54px;width:220px;height:220px;border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.28);border-radius:50%;box-shadow:0 0 60px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.panel{position:relative;height:100%;border:1px solid rgba(148,163,184,.22);border-radius:18px;background:rgba(2,6,23,.72);box-shadow:0 22px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.35);padding:38px 44px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\n.toolbar{position:absolute;top:20px;left:24px;display:flex;gap:8px}\n.dot{width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:#22c55e;box-shadow:0 0 16px rgba(34,197,94,.8)}\n.dot:nth-child(2){background:#38bdf8;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(56,189,248,.7)}\n.dot:nth-child(3){background:#f59e0b;box-shadow:0 0 14px rgba(245,158,11,.65)}\n.tag{display:inline-block;color:#86efac;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:4px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:24px}\n.prompt{color:#22c55e;margin-right:10px}\n.title{font-size:42px;font-weight:900;line-height:1.16;color:#f8fafc;max-width:640px;margin-bottom:18px;letter-spacing:.4px;text-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(34,197,94,.16)}\n.subtitle{font-size:16px;color:#a7b6c8;line-height:1.75;max-width:560px;margin-bottom:34px}\n.meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;color:#94a3b8;font-size:13px}\n.chip{border:1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.32);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 13px;color:#bbf7d0;background:rgba(34,197,94,.08);font-family:'SF Mono',Consolas,monospace}\n.author{letter-spacing:1px}\n.scanline{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:62px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#22c55e,transparent);opacity:.75}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"cover\" data-cover-style=\"geek-black\">\n  <div class=\"grid\"></div><div class=\"glow\"></div>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"toolbar\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span><span class=\"dot\"></span></div>\n    <div class=\"tag\"><span class=\"prompt\">$</span>BUILD NOTES</div>\n    <h1 class=\"title\">共学 D2：套利分层——价差、MEV 与执行成本</h1>\n    <p class=\"subtitle\">套利不是只有 MEV。价差套利找目标、MEV 拼手段、API 套利拼策略。今天盘了 Gate CrossEx、Backpack、LI.FI 与 LP 过路费，并用 LI.FI 实测 25bps 固定费如何吃穿几十 bps 的价差。</p>\n    <div class=\"meta\"><span class=\"chip\">moonpub render</span><span class=\"author\">Paxon Qiao</span></div>\n    <div class=\"scanline\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #24292f; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2da44e; border-bottom: 1px solid #b6e3ff; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">共学 D2：套利分层——价差、MEV 与执行成本</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 1.9em 0; padding: 18px 20px 18px 24px; background: #dafbe1; border: 1px solid #b6e3ff; border-left: 4px solid #2da44e; border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(15,23,42,0.05); color: #57606a; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.9; letter-spacing: 0.08em;\">链上套利残酷共学 · 第 2 天\n2026-08-06</section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.55em; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px; line-height: 2.05; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify;\">第二天的主题是「分层」。群里讨论时经常把两种完全不同的套利混在一起，我花了一天把它们拆开，顺便盘了四个工具，最后用真实报价算了一笔执行成本账。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">结论先放前面：<strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">套利不是只有 MEV，而个人开发者的路，很可能不在 MEV。</strong></p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #24292f; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2da44e; border-bottom: 1px solid #b6e3ff; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">一、价差套利 vs MEV 套利：先把概念分开</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#dafbe1;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">关注点</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>找<strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">目标</strong>：不同市场/资产间的价格不一致</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>找<strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">手段</strong>：利用交易排序权和 mempool</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">核心动作</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>买低卖高</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>抢跑 / 夹击 / 尾随</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">典型形式</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>跨所套利、三角套利、期现套利</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>三明治攻击、Back-running、清算抢跑</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">利润来源</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>市场定价失效</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>区块排序权</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">对普通用户</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>中性甚至正面（抹平价差）</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>负面（抬高交易成本）</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">依赖</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">价差套利</span>多市场数据、快速执行</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV 套利</span>mempool 可见性、区块构建权</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">实际策略里两者经常交织：发现跨所价差是价差套利，但要用 MEV 手法抢在别人前面执行——这时价差是目标，MEV 是手段。分不清这个概念，后面讨论工具、讨论策略都会跑偏。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #24292f; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2da44e; border-bottom: 1px solid #b6e3ff; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">二、今天盘的四个工具</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">1. Gate CrossEx — 跨所统一保证金</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">聚合 Binance、OKX、Bybit、Kraken、Hyperliquid、Deribit 等 7 个交易所，核心卖点是把跨所套利的两大痛点干掉：单边爆仓风险（两边浮盈浮亏对冲）和保证金平衡（不用频繁调仓）。作者实测 SKHYNIX/SKHY 溢价 40%+，6000u 10x 杠杆赚 3500u。5 倍杠杆下传统跨所波动 20% 就单边爆仓，CrossEx 要价差拉大 20% 才爆。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">2. Backpack — 交易所把套利路径喂给你</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">聚合数据后直接在界面展示套利路径，零门槛。但所有人看到同样的路径，利润窗口极短——本质是\"搬砖\"不是 alpha。它提醒我一件事：<strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">交易所展示的机会往往是竞争最充分的，真 edge 来自信息不对称或基础设施优势。</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">3. LI.FI — 跨链执行基础设施</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">聚合 Bridge、DEX、Solver 的统一 API。它不是策略系统——策略负责\"哪里有机会、扣完成本值不值得做\"，LI.FI 负责\"资金怎么走、要花多少钱、执行到哪一步\"。后面单独算账。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">4. LP 过路费 — 从套利机器人身上收钱</strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">常规路径卷不过套利机器人，那就换个方向：在机器人经常经过的位置（高流量交易对、反复穿越的价格区间）放一个高费率池，收它的过路费。入场条件是爆量、缺池、剧烈波动、反复穿越。精髓是<strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">不卷速度</strong>——承认 MEV 层面卷不过专业团队，利用他们的存在本身作为收益来源。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #24292f; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2da44e; border-bottom: 1px solid #b6e3ff; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">三、用真实报价算执行成本：25 bps 能吃掉多少价差</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">跨链套利最容易踩的坑是只看两边的价格差，忽略执行磨损。我用 LI.FI 对 Ethereum USDC → Arbitrum USDC 做了一次真实只读报价（未签名、未广播）：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2da44e;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;letter-spacing:1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;\">CODE</section>\n<section style=\"background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:0 6px 6px 6px;padding:16px;font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#7ee787;overflow-x:auto;\">\n<pre style=\"margin:0;\">输入:         1,000 USDC (Ethereum)\n预计到手:     997.5 USDC\nLI.FI 服务费: 2.5 USDC = 25 bps\nGas:          ~0.15 美元\n总显性成本:   ~2.65 美元 ≈ 26.5 bps</pre>\n</section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">结论一：稳定币跨链没有套利空间。</strong> 表面价差只有 ~9 bps，远低于 26.5 bps 的成本线。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">结论二：25 bps 是绝对大头。</strong> 套利机会的边际经常只有几十个 bps——表面价差 20 bps，光 LI.FI 费用就吃掉了；价差 40 bps，扣完 Gas、目标链滑点、延迟风险后也未必有利润。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">算账公式：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:20px 0;\">\n<section style=\"display:inline-block;background:#2da44e;color:#fff;font-weight:bold;font-size:12px;padding:6px 12px;letter-spacing:1px;border-radius:6px 6px 0 0;\">CODE</section>\n<section style=\"background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:0 6px 6px 6px;padding:16px;font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,Consolas,monospace;font-size:13px;line-height:1.75;color:#7ee787;overflow-x:auto;\">\n<pre style=\"margin:0;\">最低所需价差 = LI.FI Service Fee (25 bps)\n            + 两端 Gas\n            + 目标链交易滑点 + Price Impact\n            + 延迟 / 失败 / 资金占用成本\n            ≈ 30-35 bps（实测量级）</pre>\n</section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">结论三：更适合这条路的是非稳定币。</strong> 代币化股票（如 NVDAx）、波动性资产，或者用\"预置资金\"模式——提前在各链放好钱，不临时跨链，把\"抓机会\"和\"跨链调仓\"拆开。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #24292f; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2da44e; border-bottom: 1px solid #b6e3ff; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">四、个人开发者该走哪条路</h2>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">MEV vs API 套利的分层很清楚：</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin:22px 0;padding:12px 14px;background:#dafbe1;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:10px;\">\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">拼什么</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>mempool 监听、排序、Gas 优化、Builder 竞争</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>多 DEX 报价、价差发现、自动执行</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">需要什么</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>节点、低延迟基础设施</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>不需要节点，API 即可</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">核心竞争</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>毫秒级链上优势</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>策略、资金、滑点管理</p>\n</section>\n<section style=\"margin:0 0 12px;padding:12px 14px;background:#f6f8fa;border:1px solid #b6e3ff;border-radius:8px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\"></span><strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">适合谁</strong></p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">MEV（链底层）</span>专业团队</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 7px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.75;color:#24292f;\"><span style=\"display:block;margin:0 0 2px;color:#2da44e;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:0.08em;\">API 套利（应用层）</span>个人开发者</p>\n</section>\n</section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\">我的结论：<strong style=\"color: #24292f;\">个人开发者先做聚合套利、CEX-DEX 套利（API 层），积累策略能力后再考虑 MEV。</strong> 一层一层往上打，不要跳过 API 层直接冲链底层。</p>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<h2 style=\"font-size: 19px; font-weight: 800; color: #24292f; margin: 2.3em 0 1em; padding: 0 0 10px 14px; border-left: 5px solid #2da44e; border-bottom: 1px solid #b6e3ff; letter-spacing: 1px; line-height:1.45;\">明天做什么</h2>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 18px 0 22px; padding: 4px 0;\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;\">\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#ddf4ff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2da44e;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">1</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#ddf4ff;color:#24292f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">第一笔 devnet swap：Jupiter API 发 swap，Solscan 查详情</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#f6f8fa;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2da44e;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">2</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#f6f8fa;color:#24292f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">官方路线图 L0002：AMM 与流动性深度</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"width:34px;padding:8px 0 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;text-align:center;background:#ddf4ff;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;min-width:22px;height:22px;padding:0 4px;background:#2da44e;color:#fff;border-radius:999px;text-align:center;line-height:22px;font-size:12px;font-weight:bold;\">3</span></td><td style=\"padding:8px 12px 8px 4px;vertical-align:top;background:#ddf4ff;color:#24292f;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;\">继续验证币股价差（wNVDAx vs NVDAx，0.9% 接近转换成本 1.15% 临界点）</td></tr>\n</table></section>\n\n<section style=\"margin: 2.2em 0; text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:6px;height:6px;border:1px solid #2da44e;border-radius:50%;margin:0 10px;vertical-align:middle;background:#f6f8fa;\"></span><section style=\"display:inline-block;width:42px;height:2px;background:#b6e3ff;vertical-align:middle;\"></section></section>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 0 0 1.25em; color: #24292f; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.95; letter-spacing: 0.08em; word-spacing: 0.05em; text-align: justify; text-indent: 2em;\"><em>本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</em></p>\n\n\n\n<section style=\"margin-top:3em;padding-top:2em;border-top:1px solid #e8e8e8;\">\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0;color:#57606a;font-size:15px;text-align:center;\">— · —</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#2da44e;font-size:15px;text-align:center;font-weight:bold;\">寻月隐君</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.6em 0;color:#57606a;font-size:14px;text-align:center;line-height:1.8;\">专注 Web3、Python、Go、Rust 技术分享，探索区块链、智能合约、DApp 等前沿内容。<br>\n技术的光，未来的道。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1em 0 0.4em;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;text-align:left;line-height:1.8;\">本文为个人学习记录，不构成投资建议。链上套利有风险，请自行评估。</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:1.2em 0 0.6em;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">扫码加入「寻月阁」共学群</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKaxGEuEoB4JnHlwP423gdwDSwN1KjDJBG7ib0q2APRqF3rNuyHZiaL01bpo4LI4mmicOs3D2b50Su8k2WiaByG6aOZQu9LuyvKg9Crs/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"display:block;margin:0 auto;max-width:80%;width:240px;height:auto;\" alt=\"群二维码\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;margin:1.5em 0 0.8em;\"><img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/22kVflKPKawncEewIB1kQhibxvLib14deYWLyLZ4AicMfqatcm5aMUb8qx6EMpwvLwTpgI3PWkvkia3RRjaXZn5SYXS748IbtTuic7R2eaQtdWSw/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" style=\"max-width:100%;\" alt=\"关注\"></p>\n\n<p style=\"margin:0.8em 0;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;text-align:center;\">关注《寻月隐君》，一起在技术的星空下寻找属于自己的明月。</p>\n\n</section>\n\n\n</section>\n\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
    }
